DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260510T173000
UID:5f978f4713254631ca1a1df9@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:All authentic Buddhist practices and teachings stem from the B
 uddha’s transcendental attainment under the Bodhi tree in northern India
  two and a half thousand years ago. Buddha Day is especially important for
  the LBC this year\, as it coincides with the 10th anniversary of the buil
 ding of our retreat centre\, Vajrasana.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/buddha-day-festival-2026
 -05-10
